# Provider API keys (BYOK).
#
# The Tasaciones add-in stores API keys in IndexedDB on the user's machine,
# not in this file. Office.js webview cannot read .env (Vite shims process.env
# to "{}" for the browser bundle), so these values are here only for local
# development helpers (proxies, bridges, smoke tests) that DO run outside the
# browser.
#
# Uncomment the lines you need. NEVER commit real keys — `.env` is gitignored
# and only `.env.example` is tracked.
#
# See docs/guides/install.md and /settings in the add-in for the supported
# BYOK providers.

# Anthropic (Claude)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI (GPT, Codex)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Google Gemini
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (recommended — single key, dozens of models)
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Custom OpenAI-compatible gateway
# CUSTOM_GATEWAY_BASE_URL=
# CUSTOM_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
